CHAPTER.VERS:
Ho, ho, flee from the land of the north, says Yahweh; for I have spread you

          {+}
         abroad as the four winds of the heavens, says Yahweh.

For this is what Yahweh of Hosts says: After glory he has sent me to the nations which plundered you

          {+}
        ; for he who touches you

          {+}
         touches the apple of my eye.

For, look, I will shake my hand over them, and they will be a spoil to their slaves; and you

          {+}
         will know that Yahweh of hosts has sent me.
